{"id":"1379117527154974722","date":"2021-04-05","url":"https://x.com/logangraham/status/1379117527154974722","author":"logangraham","text":"@brandonhli @TurnerNovak This is nothing compared to the courage and resilience in this story\n\nhttps://t.co/8ydUD85e94","reply_to":"brandonhli","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/TurnerNovak/status/1378716885810872322","text":"When Ronald McDonald lost his circus job in 1929, all the top VC’s (Sequoia, Benchmark, WeWork Ventures, Chamath) passed on his new “fast food” restaurant\n\nBy 2020, his company was worth $169 billion and Ronald was the 6th richest person in the world\n\nNever give up on your dreams https://t.co/Or9yawLfYH"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20210405170351","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210405170351/https://twitter.com/logangraham/status/1379117527154974722","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
